    "preamble": "Makbul Khan vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 25 February, 2020 Author: Rajeev Kumar Shrivastava Bench: Rajeev Kumar Shrivastava",
    "facts": "The petitioner has been falsely implicated in the case on the basis of concocted story prepared by the prosecution. Per contra, learned State counsel has opposed the submissions and prayed for rejection of the application on the ground that offence committed by the petitioner is serious in nature and against the society; therefore, no case is made out to suspend the jail sentence and grant bail to the petitioner.",
